看这输出一头雾水吗？不必担心，下面将逐步解释

** 创建一个 <derivation>

如果打开 guix 的源代码，查看 guix/derivations.scm 可以看到有以下定义， derivations 的定义是一个 record

#+begin_src scheme
  (define-immutable-record-type <derivation>
  (make-derivation outputs inputs sources system builder args env-vars
                   file-name)
  derivation?
  (outputs  derivation-outputs)      ; list of name/<derivation-output> pairs
  (inputs   derivation-inputs)       ; list of <derivation-input>
  (sources  derivation-sources)      ; list of store paths
  (system   derivation-system)       ; string
  (builder  derivation-builder)      ; store path
  (args     derivation-builder-arguments)         ; list of strings
  (env-vars derivation-builder-environment-vars)  ; list of name/value pairs
  (file-name derivation-file-name))               ; the .drv file name
#+end_src

** 在 guix repl 中构建 derivation
可以使用 ,lower 或者 lower-object 将 package define 转变成 derivation 或者 store item

#+begin_example
scheme@(guile-user)> ,use (guix)
scheme@(guile-user)> ,use (gnu packages glib)
scheme@(guile-user)> glib
$1 = #<package glib@2.86.0 gnu/packages/glib.scm:448 7f87ffea9bb0>
scheme@(guile-user)> ,lower glib
$2 = #<derivation /gnu/store/15lk1yrv22izdn07q08470rld951yln5-glib-2.86.0.drv => /gnu/store/gjsllywm543ba987yhslfpxqjfhc4m04-glib-2.86.0-bin /gnu/store/zf2pgpxma4vjjnhlsm67yfbvpy664nzh-glib-2.86.0-debug /gnu/store/71ffz3bdgyg53ncyj7z7dykyax6vysv4-glib-2.86.0 /gnu/store/75ij7i0rxa2shy168mdvj2gcjhd805lb-glib-2.86.0-static 7f87fd9837d0>
scheme@(guile-user)> (derivation-system $2)
$3 = "x86_64-linux"
#+end_example

- ,use (guix) ，使用 (guix) module
- ,use (gnu packages glib) ，使用 glib module ，使用 glib 的 pakcage define
- glib ，输出 glib 的 binding ，可以看到第一个输出 ($1) 输出了一个 package define
- ,lower glib ，使用 lower 构建一个 derivation ，这是输出 $2
- derivation-system ，使用 derivation-system 查看输出 $2 的 derivation record 的 system 属性

当然上面的操作是在 guix repl 里面进行的，接下来我们在 guile 程序文件中进行

** 在 scheme 文件中构建 derivation

pk 调试宏，在定义时使用 write 将输出打印在终端注释中

#+begin_src scheme
  (use-modules (guix)
               (gnu packages glib))

  (pk (lower-object glib))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; (#<procedure 7f8801e3a080 at guix/gexp.scm:294:2 (state)>)
$1 = #<procedure 7f8801e3a080 at guix/gexp.scm:294:2 (state)>
#+end_example

可以看到输出是一个 procedure 在 gexp (G-Expression)里

现在还没解释 G-Expression ，不过我们可以知道使用 pk 来直接打印输出

现在可以使用 run-with-store 将输出的 G-Expression 构建成 derivation

#+begin_src scheme
  (use-modules (guix)
               (guix derivations)
               (guix gexp)
               (guix packages)
               (guix store)
               (gnu packages glib))

  (define glib-drv
    (pk (with-store %store
          (run-with-store %store
            (lower-object glib)))))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; (#<derivation /gnu/store/1klr30hzvylr6kp0gpnb7dz32b3r13pi-glib-2.83.3.drv => /gnu/store/hxnsnqp9zhcrysgs32447l7a9jn4hvas-glib-2.83.3-bin /gnu/store/cgx1pz9krybwvmcqrn81v8rzgbh6xzi7-glib-2.83.3-debug /gnu/store/wvykg0f5nyfyav7k3pc0pdjpz8yks58j-glib-2.83.3 /gnu/store/m5d0pdgx3am588pg62ri5xh1qvq8kqff-glib-2.83.3-static 7f8ee4f9c500>)
#+end_example

现在得到了一个 derivation ，我们使用 derivation record 里的访问 procedure 访问其属性

#+begin_src scheme
  (define glib-outputs
    (pk (derivation-outputs glib-drv)))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; ((("bin" . #<<derivation-output> path: "/gnu/store/hxnsnqp9zhcrysgs32447l7a9jn4hvas-glib-2.83.3-bin" hash-algo: #f hash: #f recursive?: #f>) ("debug" . #<<derivation-output> path: "/gnu/store/cgx1pz9krybwvmcqrn81v8rzgbh6xzi7-glib-2.83.3-debug" hash-algo: #f hash: #f recursive?: #f>) ("out" . #<<derivation-output> path: "/gnu/store/wvykg0f5nyfyav7k3pc0pdjpz8yks58j-glib-2.83.3" hash-algo: #f hash: #f recursive?: #f>) ("static" . #<<derivation-output> path: "/gnu/store/m5d0pdgx3am588pg62ri5xh1qvq8kqff-glib-2.83.3-static" hash-algo: #f hash: #f recursive?: #f>)))
#+end_example

** 详解 <derivation>

*** <derivation-output>

derivation-output 是一个 alist ，可以使用 assoc-ref 访问其属性

#+begin_src scheme
  (pk (assoc-ref glib-outputs "out"))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; (#<<derivation-output> path: "/gnu/store/wvykg0f5nyfyav7k3pc0pdjpz8yks58j-glib-2.83.3" hash-algo: #f hash: #f recursive?: #f>)
$1 = #<<derivation-output> path: "/gnu/store/wvykg0f5nyfyav7k3pc0pdjpz8yks58j-glib-2.83.3" hash-algo: #f hash: #f recursive?: #f>
#+end_example

可以看到 hash 和 hash-algo 没有值，查看使用 guix build --derivations glib 的输出文件可以看到

#+begin_example
Derive([... , ("out" . #<<derivation-output> path: "/gnu/store/wvykg0f5nyfyav7k3pc0pdjpz8yks58j-glib-2.83.3" hash-algo: #f hash: #f recursive?: #f>), ... ])
#+end_example

是对应的

可以构建 glib 的源代码包来获取 hash 和 hash-algo
#+begin_src scheme
  (use-modules (guix)
               (guix derivations)
               (guix gexp)
               (guix packages)
               (guix store)
               (gnu packages glib))

  (define glib-src-drv
    (pk (with-store %store
          (run-with-store %store
            (lower-object (package-source glib))))))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; (#<derivation /gnu/store/hyw0lbrgs08jrfxkhja5fkw2yhj6973x-glib-2.83.3.tar.zst.drv => /gnu/store/0rhm7v75hxm4yldspdpb24zzs2akw6z1-glib-2.83.3.tar.zst 7f8ee4ec9b90>)
#+end_example

#+begin_src scheme
  (define glib-src-outputs
    (pk (derivation-outputs glib-src-drv)))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; ((("out" . #<<derivation-output> path: "/gnu/store/0rhm7v75hxm4yldspdpb24zzs2akw6z1-glib-2.83.3.tar.zst" hash-algo: #f hash: #f recursive?: #f>)))
#+end_example

#+begin_src scheme
    (pk (assoc-ref glib-src-outputs "out"))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; (#<<derivation-output> path: "/gnu/store/0rhm7v75hxm4yldspdpb24zzs2akw6z1-glib-2.83.3.tar.zst" hash-algo: #f hash: #f recursive?: #f>)
$1 = #<<derivation-output> path: "/gnu/store/0rhm7v75hxm4yldspdpb24zzs2akw6z1-glib-2.83.3.tar.zst" hash-algo: #f hash: #f recursive?: #f>
#+end_example

可以看到 hash 和 hash-algo 已经有值了

*** derivation-input

之前 guix build --derivations glib 的输出 .drv 里的第二个字段 (第二个 "[]" 里的内容)

#+begin_example
Derive(... , [("/gnu/store/13mfnsf82hbc8x6skdx6jywzvgm6zdp3-patch-2.7.6.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/2vjnv7mvr1s7ssxq85x3vcvi30v2xayb-python-pyparsing-3.2.3.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/30n7ps4aw7kj2cywv9clqilaqmrhr0rx-ninja-1.13.2.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/482qbdf67z1m15q0rg8zswi9yfr3vqpa-coreutils-9.1.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/4gr3sfaakkmhhcsvzbipc7d5l4w52hdv-zstd-1.5.6.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/518dcgk4sgy8573xfrivnqpkwg85bjgg-m4-1.4.19.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/55frf22sjqn5jfrg46za8vbc9fpckyqk-make-4.4.1.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/60a297ppwa6z4yndl36gx6rvq8ncx13n-file-5.46.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/72in2fpp6ixcvlg2r38n4fix5dgbfnxv-zlib-1.3.1.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/73i639pm0p29d0218nz92m4c6zfslkh0-xz-5.4.5.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/74ylcq016k5z7f3iqqvaijsgjpw0mfzd-python-packaging-25.0.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/78gafdwlhm823cyj6c0f6n3zl4r6v9lr-python-docutils-0.21.2.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/7nzw07mn4yvp61vcn0kncfy5kf0gjrr4-gzip-1.14.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/82lmcralzn78fxkakhrygwfyixr6nz00-pcre2-10.42.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/8j321wg9fll4llhn64vghkkhpsl1mdry-tzdata-2025a.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/8jzdi0wv2b9ghy0g54ydnq726ca50ldd-glib-2.83.3.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/8v12p5m3zn46znl9bmlfssxz1n4fvrvb-util-linux-2.40.4.drv",["lib"]),("/gnu/store/9267ajw5a1jr8bs13vpfxmg8gwnq9a11-meson-1.9.0.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/999889hgqba38np9hqswml2px9v5p3mm-python-markdown-3.10.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/9q6q41khq5f6d2zqpaar2ds933g2r11z-python-typogrify-2.1.0.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/azbim3sh56721lnfc3r54cn4nij6629n-python-jinja2-3.1.2.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/b4096cawvhhqmw16adjqd5xqc7blhd9y-glibc-2.41.drv",["out","static"]),("/gnu/store/c18zwjasa094gg9ngl5l4xkwwfqdh7lz-guile-3.0.9.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/cmrpqf49chpg4jkzbg08pl607084wiy6-tar-1.35.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/d23dp6z581fy03krb8w3xsljr685ixqn-linux-libre-headers-6.12.17.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/dahxmsgr5g1q30r50m4frvffsap84i9i-gi-docgen-2025.4.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/dgzxhfbbj4lc5kfd8wz8jq2ng1j7q05z-pkg-config-0.29.2.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/dk1s5za9z31x3l5k2g5j92w5bq12fbsp-findutils-4.10.0.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/dmmzp028rydn980q6zzwb4h5c1a5psiq-gawk-5.3.0.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/dwpsrgjd64azcimz7pvnik8d149y2c6y-gcc-14.3.0.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/ghj8p20p63zh2ffj6bf6jhv38xrkp89f-sed-4.9.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/hyw0lbrgs08jrfxkhja5fkw2yhj6973x-glib-2.83.3.tar.zst.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/i4wk699p170bnbvp5pwy8cdjhwpc6zgj-python-3.11.14.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/ifda1ljsndmmgxy7wf0sya9ikifd959i-python-smartypants-2.0.2.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/ih3dxlr9z4lf1mhqd5m8yr9319rq1da2-gettext-minimal-0.23.1.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/l49zk72wc49jm6dkmchafhfp4ybb28xc-bash-minimal-5.2.37.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/ldzv4bzs354aih42ffyw72192svaynyn-perl-5.36.0.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/lp2j6vrchf6l14m95x0zhjxxrcikqngi-diffutils-3.12.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/m9q1l872hgz6b8s7yvca7b9527kn4njw-binutils-2.44.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/p0zf5fj4mgz2ylmcdb9vpb1cbqi75qfn-bash-minimal-5.2.37.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/pnaknvq67bf3iba3d8yplanjc3b4g7ij-grep-3.11.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/q0y84hk5qh6ayzr201glf3nr7kfbillk-libffi-3.4.6.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/qbg1w9bzpcnjd5bz9by09837ql7c96y2-ld-wrapper-0.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/qblkzckhn7pq7a2qfpdbnksj51ll4jzz-dbus-1.15.8.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/qicacllcw24zimbdfzcc2rk78hmmgdmp-bzip2-1.0.8.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/rc81h00fphz1lm2wgsamfzw8hx6nh374-python-pygments-2.19.1.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/rfczralhnnn21gvhxf7akiskph3wvz9x-gobject-introspection-1.82.0.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/rzhdj91f14alyyqy9nzxg2b398vmyq86-python-wrapper-3.11.14.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/skbxipqshzhgqax43rlsq20cbmryr4vm-module-import-compiled.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/xgb1hrd3lmhhklyjdx03gl6y21jkiwj5-python-markupsafe-3.0.2.drv",["out"]),("/gnu/store/zbaxcwmqdh9klh5c03iisgngj0238yly-python-six-1.17.0.drv",["out"])], ...)
#+end_example

这个元组显示了 build glib 前需要构建的 derivations

当然，访问 derivation-input 可以使用相似的方式

#+begin_src scheme
  (define glib-inputs
    (pk (derivation-inputs glib-drv)))
#+end_src

#+begin_src scheme
  (pk (car glib-inputs))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; (#<<derivation-input> drv: #<derivation /gnu/store/13mfnsf82hbc8x6skdx6jywzvgm6zdp3-patch-2.7.6.drv => /gnu/store/3yky2jh15qsknnxnzplhj4by14sqmfig-patch-2.7.6 7f8ee5a91a00> sub-derivations: ("out")>)
$1 = #<<derivation-input> drv: #<derivation /gnu/store/13mfnsf82hbc8x6skdx6jywzvgm6zdp3-patch-2.7.6.drv => /gnu/store/3yky2jh15qsknnxnzplhj4by14sqmfig-patch-2.7.6 7f8ee5a91a00> sub-derivations: ("out")>
#+end_exampler

*** Build Configuration

第三个元组是 derivation-sources

#+begin_example
Derive(... , ["/gnu/store/dcq2ajaz0vhaj0j3m7wdfw3axwzrkp3c-glib-2.83.3-builder","/gnu/store/j6fmbrwhvwsbk0wka86xpxafs48v6nqj-module-import"], ...)
#+end_example

- /gnu/store/dcq2ajaz0vhaj0j3m7wdfw3axwzrkp3c-glib-2.83.3-builder 是 glib 的构建脚本
- /gnu/store/j6fmbrwhvwsbk0wka86xpxafs48v6nqj-module-import 是将被添加到 %load-path 的额外路径

可以通过 derivation-source 访问

#+begin_src scheme
  (pk (derivation-sources glib-drv))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; (("/gnu/store/6kg7cn4nh9cjfdgk7yj2rhw8fs6cxa60-glib-2.83.3-builder" "/gnu/store/j6fmbrwhvwsbk0wka86xpxafs48v6nqj-module-import"))
$1 = ("/gnu/store/6kg7cn4nh9cjfdgk7yj2rhw8fs6cxa60-glib-2.83.3-builder" "/gnu/store/j6fmbrwhvwsbk0wka86xpxafs48v6nqj-module-import")
#+end_example

剩下部分访问同理

#+begin_src scheme
  (pk (derivation-system glib-drv))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; ("x86_64-linux")
$2 = "x86_64-linux"
#+end_example

#+begin_src scheme
  (pk (derivation-builder glib-drv))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; ("/gnu/store/77cxm55d0ns4d4gza1xnd4frb1bc4im3-guile-3.0.9/bin/guile")
$3 = "/gnu/store/77cxm55d0ns4d4gza1xnd4frb1bc4im3-guile-3.0.9/bin/guile"
#+end_example

#+begin_src scheme
  (pk (derivation-builder-arguments glib-drv))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; (("--no-auto-compile" "-L" "/gnu/store/j6fmbrwhvwsbk0wka86xpxafs48v6nqj-module-import" "-C" "/gnu/store/lbwpx5857x3aynblihk30p318azn8xfk-module-import-compiled" "/gnu/store/6kg7cn4nh9cjfdgk7yj2rhw8fs6cxa60-glib-2.83.3-builder"))
$4 = ("--no-auto-compile" "-L" "/gnu/store/j6fmbrwhvwsbk0wka86xpxafs48v6nqj-module-import" "-C" "/gnu/store/lbwpx5857x3aynblihk30p318azn8xfk-module-import-compiled" "/gnu/store/6kg7cn4nh9cjfdgk7yj2rhw8fs6cxa60-glib-2.83.3-builder")
#+end_example

最后一个字段包含在构建时的环境变量列表

#+begin_src scheme
  (pk (derivation-builder-environment-vars glib-drv))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; ((("LC_CTYPE" . "C.UTF-8") ("bin" . "/gnu/store/hxnsnqp9zhcrysgs32447l7a9jn4hvas-glib-2.83.3-bin") ("debug" . "/gnu/store/cgx1pz9krybwvmcqrn81v8rzgbh6xzi7-glib-2.83.3-debug") ("disallowedReferences" . "/gnu/store/1zwwykw79j5xz1iaiia56hwqxdqnrk2c-tzdata-2025a") ("out" . "/gnu/store/wvykg0f5nyfyav7k3pc0pdjpz8yks58j-glib-2.83.3") ("static" . "/gnu/store/m5d0pdgx3am588pg62ri5xh1qvq8kqff-glib-2.83.3-static")))
$5 = (("LC_CTYPE" . "C.UTF-8") ("bin" . "/gnu/store/hxnsnqp9zhcrysgs32447l7a9jn4hvas-glib-2.83.3-bin") ("debug" . "/gnu/store/cgx1pz9krybwvmcqrn81v8rzgbh6xzi7-glib-2.83.3-debug") ("disallowedReferences" . "/gnu/store/1zwwykw79j5xz1iaiia56hwqxdqnrk2c-tzdata-2025a") ("out" . "/gnu/store/wvykg0f5nyfyav7k3pc0pdjpz8yks58j-glib-2.83.3") ("static" . "/gnu/store/m5d0pdgx3am588pg62ri5xh1qvq8kqff-glib-2.83.3-static"))
#+end_example

** 使用 <derivation>

<derivation> 与 .drv 文件之间的转换可以使用 write-derivation, read-derivation 和 read-derivation-from-file

#+begin_src scheme
  (define manual-drv
    (with-store %store
      (derivation %store "manual"
                  "/bin/sh" '())))

  (write-derivation manual-drv (current-output-port))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
Derive([("out","/gnu/store/9zzigy9l9wxk6nv1vz4s6k5mi576km38-manual","","")],[],[],"x86_64-linux","/bin/sh",[],[("out","/gnu/store/9zzigy9l9wxk6nv1vz4s6k5mi576km38-manual")])
#+end_example

#+begin_src scheme
  (pk (read-derivation-from-file (derivation-file-name glib-drv)))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; (#<derivation /gnu/store/1klr30hzvylr6kp0gpnb7dz32b3r13pi-glib-2.83.3.drv => /gnu/store/hxnsnqp9zhcrysgs32447l7a9jn4hvas-glib-2.83.3-bin /gnu/store/cgx1pz9krybwvmcqrn81v8rzgbh6xzi7-glib-2.83.3-debug /gnu/store/wvykg0f5nyfyav7k3pc0pdjpz8yks58j-glib-2.83.3 /gnu/store/m5d0pdgx3am588pg62ri5xh1qvq8kqff-glib-2.83.3-static 7f8ee4f9c500>)
$6 = #<derivation /gnu/store/1klr30hzvylr6kp0gpnb7dz32b3r13pi-glib-2.83.3.drv => /gnu/store/hxnsnqp9zhcrysgs32447l7a9jn4hvas-glib-2.83.3-bin /gnu/store/cgx1pz9krybwvmcqrn81v8rzgbh6xzi7-glib-2.83.3-debug /gnu/store/wvykg0f5nyfyav7k3pc0pdjpz8yks58j-glib-2.83.3 /gnu/store/m5d0pdgx3am588pg62ri5xh1qvq8kqff-glib-2.83.3-static 7f8ee4f9c500>
#+end_example

#+begin_src scheme
  (call-with-input-file (derivation-file-name glib-drv)
    read-derivation)
#+end_src

#+begin_example
$7 = #<derivation /gnu/store/1klr30hzvylr6kp0gpnb7dz32b3r13pi-glib-2.83.3.drv => /gnu/store/hxnsnqp9zhcrysgs32447l7a9jn4hvas-glib-2.83.3-bin /gnu/store/cgx1pz9krybwvmcqrn81v8rzgbh6xzi7-glib-2.83.3-debug /gnu/store/wvykg0f5nyfyav7k3pc0pdjpz8yks58j-glib-2.83.3 /gnu/store/m5d0pdgx3am588pg62ri5xh1qvq8kqff-glib-2.83.3-static 7f8ee5087500>
#+end_example

可以使用 build-derivations 构建 <derivation>

#+begin_src scheme
  (use-modules (ice-9 ftw))

  (define glib-drv-out
    (pk (derivation-output-path
         (assoc-ref (derivation-outputs glib-drv) "out"))))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; ("/gnu/store/wvykg0f5nyfyav7k3pc0pdjpz8yks58j-glib-2.83.3")
#+end_example

检查 glib-drv-out 目录，得到 #f ，也就是目录为空
#+begin_src scheme
  (pk (scandir glib-drv-out))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; (#f)
$8 = #f
#+end_example

#+begin_src scheme
  (pk (with-store %store (build-derivations %store (list glib-drv))))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; (#t)
$9 = #t
#+end_example

到这里返回 #t 就构建成功了

检查 glib-drv-out 目录

#+begin_src scheme
  (pk (scandir glib-drv-out))
#+end_src

#+begin_example
;;; (("." ".." "etc" "include" "lib" "libexec" "share"))
$10 = ("." ".." "etc" "include" "lib" "libexec" "share")
#+end_example

可以看到已经输出了构建项

** 总结

1. derivation-outputs derivation的各种输出路径
2. derivation-inputs 需要 build 的其他 derivation
3. derivation-sources 构建 script 和 被添加到 %load-path 的路径
4. derivation-system 编译的目标系统类型
5. derivation-builder 目标的可执行文件
6. derivation-builder-arguments 将要传递给 build 的 arguments (参数)
7. derivation-builder-environment-vars 在 build 过程中设置的环境变量

* G-Expressions
Guix 需要一些在构建软件包时运行的代码，为了创建一个在相对输出目录里的文件，还需要某种方式来引用依赖关系。
G-Expressions 用来实现这个"被推迟"的代码？

联系上一节 derivation-source 的元组中第一个元素“构建脚本”，脚本中定义了 build-phases, %build-inputs, %outputs, %output

可以在构建时引用构建脚本里的定义，使用 S-Expressions 构建一个 store item 的 bin/glib 文件 glib包装

#+begin_src scheme
  (define sexp-builder
    `(let* ((out (assoc-ref %outputs "out"))
            (glib (assoc-ref %build-inputs "glib"))
            (bin/glib (string-append glib "/bin/glib")))
       (symlink bin/glib out)))
#+end_src

%outputs 和 %build-inputs 在构建脚本中以 alist 定义

